## Title: Amobi Guild |cffe9cb88阿莫比公會名單|r
## Title-zhTW: |cffe9cb88阿莫比|r 公會名單
## Notes: Saves your guild roster for the wowamobi.com auction room (only guild members can open a run), and receives the auction prices and boss drops your guild members' Amobi Companion records, and the honor kills and item sources (vendors, quest rewards, mob and chest drops) of any same-faction player's Companion (addon messages; install on the Alliance and the Horde account). Owner's computers only. /amobiguild
## Notes-zhTW: 記下公會名單給阿莫比網站競拍場用（開單限公會成員），並收公會成員的小幫手傳來的拍賣場物價、首領掉落，和同陣營玩家的小幫手傳來的榮譽擊殺、物品來源（商人、任務獎勵、怪物和寶箱掉落）（聯盟、部落帳號各裝一個）。只裝在站長自己的電腦、不公開下載。/amobiguild 看讀到幾人、收到多少
